    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《Ha̍k仔》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">藍春瑞&nbsp;</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjSlQqGTeZ9SWjtTdk1mt_pe04RvsksYe5xGx0sphRtWu87h9GNC1c6C2XEdHvZEfxcBny0DollIOwaJjuwDVkLA5HFLRfcreFbpVmSb_o8U055Ct-pAh9MknVUI-AZuSwKWKTOm_Il9Y6-YS46AUW4e4S1t5-_BneAfghq8Kpm0AAVDeTxSsOoPGt4zdYR\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjSlQqGTeZ9SWjtTdk1mt_pe04RvsksYe5xGx0sphRtWu87h9GNC1c6C2XEdHvZEfxcBny0DollIOwaJjuwDVkLA5HFLRfcreFbpVmSb_o8U055Ct-pAh9MknVUI-AZuSwKWKTOm_Il9Y6-YS46AUW4e4S1t5-_BneAfghq8Kpm0AAVDeTxSsOoPGt4zdYR=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">M̄管好額、散赤，iah是老--ê、少年，kah是ē lim、ē食，屎尿逐工ài放，tsîng到tann lóng無變--過，有變--ê是tháu放ê所在換khah清氣、sù-sī，kah íng過差有夠濟。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">見若想著囡仔時代ê便所，就知影hit-tang-tsūn日子是偌艱苦leh過，m̄是lán現此時想ē到--ê，真正是『好驚人』tsit三字，tsiah有法度解sueh tsit項ng-ng-iap-iap，一日幾若改、無去bē煞ê代誌。我若khioh tse來講hōo阮囝聽，in m̄-nā無人beh信，koh ē笑講：「阿爸，mài koh liū tsia-ê古早古早番薯食kah飽ê代誌--ah。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">早前hōo人放屎尿ê所在就是「ha̍k仔」，下跤積屎、尿ê窟仔號做「屎ha̍k仔」。「Ha̍k仔」是用磚仔khōng ê窟仔，差不多到人ê腰hiah深niâ，是驚萬不二，囡仔無張持跋--落ê緣故。窟仔頂khuè一塊四尺三尺ê枋坪，hōo人做跤踏，枋坪ê中ng挖一个長tu形ê四角空，闊25公分，是lán人khû--落-去，兩肢跤後蹬ê sio離，啊若長度極ke 50公分niâ。枋坪ê頂kuân，搭一間簡單ê寮仔，hōo人放屎尿ê時tsūn，有一个仔內外，tsa̍h風兼遮雨。另外tī寮仔ê內角，有一跤籃仔，囥一堆五寸長、四分闊，用竹bi̍h仔做ê屎pue，hōo人放屎了後，提來kueh kha-tshng頭，一枝無夠用兩枝……，kueh--過，隨tàn落去屎ha̍k仔底。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tī未有化學肥料ê進前，窟仔底ê屎尿是上讚ê肥丹，沃菜上ha̍h，koh ē-tàng擔去賣--人，是iúnn肥ê人tsiah有ê外路仔。所以講「屎ha̍k仔」有黃金，是囥寶ê所在，m̄是凊彩人ē-sái來iúnn。若有ha̍k仔，無料beh hōo人khioh肥，我kah你掛插，決定排規列sio搶beh ti̍h，若無影，頭殼hōo你phut起來準椅仔坐！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">無疑誤今仔日ê世情，ē變到全用清水kā屎尿tshiâng去號做『污水幹管』ê大溝，目睭準無看著屎、尿仝款總排tuì外海去。另外koh來發明一寡化學肥料、農藥來沃菜，講án-ne khah衛生、khah進步。Tsiah-koh來嫌講，tiâu tī菜蔬ê肥料、農藥，若食落去腹內，ē礙著身體、ē致癌、ē汙染環境等等，對人有敗害ê齣頭直透suan--出-來，親像「搬石頭摃家己ê跤盤」siāng款，真正是「弟子做孽，應該死好！」Tse kám ē是lán人gōng kah飼bē大，tsiah ē去發明tsit款giàn頭代誌來苦毒家己--leh？</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：https://reurl.cc/M35kgn）</span></div><div style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></div></span></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div></span></div><div><span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: ari